  "verified_boundaries": [
    "Two audit Node scripts are loaded only after normal autoload/Menu startup, instantiated without add_child, and explicitly freed; their _ready/gameplay methods are not called. Only their audit representation helpers and the actual Codec are used.",
    "FrozenProject copies the fixed actual runtime/native addons, snapshots complete pre-import inventory, then freezes cold metadata. Inherited integrity preserves exact source/spec/review/data pins, all terminal native logs against original step SHA, native dependencies and installed identity.",
    "OwnedSerialBatch retains natural idle/own PID+nonce/profile, unknown child cleanup and lease release gates. Normal CAMPAIGN_QA empty and STEAM_DISABLED=1 remain guarded.",
    "Original raw saved_packet SHA is fixed in both native checks and host registry; it is never written or promoted to complete-matrix fixture.",
    "Host derives exact observation and mandatory check sets for all 22 raw sections, 54 complete decoded Unit payloads and complete Level. It enforces nonce/PID/native marker, passed labels, typed nonnegative timings/byte counts, and all global qualification flags false.",
    "No performance superiority assertion is present, and V9 failed/partial matrix evidence is not accepted as full-chain success."
  ],
  "findings": [
    {
      "id": "BENCH-COLD-001",
      "severity": "blocking",
      "file": "D:\\AI项目\\水浒\\开发工程\\tools\\campaign_component_audit_benchmark_v1.gd",
      "line": 24,
      "title": "candidate_cold_us is measured with cache inherited from earlier cases",
      "detail": "fresh.audit_leaf_cache persists across every _compare invocation. By the second case and later complete sections, earlier scalar keys are already cached, so candidate_cold_us does not measure an empty/cold candidate cache. These observations cannot be interpreted as cold-versus-warm cost.",
      "required_fix": "For each cold measurement clear the probe-owned candidate cache and verify/record zero entries before starting the timer; keep the repeated warm measurement on that same case. Alternatively label cumulative-cache cost accurately and separately provide a genuine cold measurement."
    },
    {
      "id": "BENCH-COVERAGE-002",
      "severity": "blocking",
      "file": "D:\\AI项目\\水浒\\开发工程\\tools\\campaign_component_audit_benchmark_v1.gd",
      "line": 53,
      "title": "Changed cache eligibility/capacity and shared-container alias boundaries are not explicitly exercised",
      "detail": "The fixed scalar fixture and one ordinary mutable dictionary do not test 256/257-character text eligibility, saturation beyond 8192 unique scalar entries, or a shared container referenced through multiple branches followed by mutation. The current <=8192 check can pass without ever reaching the capacity/miss branch. Real packet comparisons provide broad representation coverage but do not guarantee these new cache boundaries.",
      "required_fix": "Add isolated exact old/new typed+fingerprint comparisons for text boundary cases, >8192 unique eligible scalars with measured capacity and post-cap misses, and shared-container alias mutation. Keep original R5/R6 sources immutable and add the new case labels/counts to host mandatory validation."
    }
  ],
